":"Lily wants to buy some paint for my wooden stars!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Yugiri","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"120,-150","spriteScale":"1.85"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Yugiri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mm... I suppose I should buy some pearls as ornaments for the hairpins."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Saki","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-190","spriteScale":"1.4"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Saki Nikaido","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Woohoo! At last, a balance beam!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Romero","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,240","spriteScale":"1.25"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Romero","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Awoooowooo!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone seems satisfied with the outcome. Even Romero is rolling around happily on the grass."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone, that is, except you."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You sit amidst a pile of wood shavings and sawdust, dazed by your failure to once again decipher Tae-speak."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Tae","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-290","spriteScale":"1.3"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tae Yamada","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uhrahh... Urrghur... (She gesticulates toward you with an expectant look on her face.)"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Tae","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,-290","spriteScale":"1.3"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's the matter, Tae?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She hands you a solid block of wood and traces a circle on it, makes a sprinkling motion with her hand as if she's scattering dried shredded squid on it, and 